flowchart LR
    User[Tester or CI] --> CLI[Framework CLI]
    CLI --> Artifact[Artifact Engine]
    CLI --> Device[Device Core]
    CLI --> Flow[Flow Engine]
    Artifact --> APK[APK AAB APKS]
    Device --> ADB[ADB Driver]
    Device -. optional .-> Appium[Appium Driver]
    ADB --> Phone[Android Device]
    Appium --> Phone
    Flow --> Adapter[Game Adapter]
    Adapter --> Config[Config Reader]
    Adapter --> Routes[Route Definitions]
    Adapter --> Locator[Locator Resolver]
    Adapter --> Oracle[State and Business Assertions]
    Flow --> Evidence[Evidence Collector]
    Device --> Evidence
    Artifact --> Evidence
    Evidence --> Reports[JSON JUnit Logs Screenshots Performance]
